kaeru (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release of Kaeru 0.1.1.
  * Keep awake via xdg-desktop-portal Inhibit with logind sleep:block fallback.
  * Focus timer (countdown + Pomodoro) with quiet-hours-aware notifications.
  * Work log with SQLite storage, conservative crash recovery and CSV export
    (spreadsheet formula-injection protected).
  * Official frog icon identity (awake / focused / sleep expressions) in the
    tray, launcher and application window.
  * Tray menu, single-instance D-Bus control and CLI
    (kaeru awake|focus|work|export|status|diagnostics).

